2. PASTIKAN NGROK TERINSTALL
Cek: buka terminal, ketik: ngrok version
Jika error: download dari https://ngrok.com/download
🚀 LANGKAH UTAMA (Setiap Kali Mau Testing)
STEP 1: Buka Terminal
# Masuk ke folder project
cd 'D:\xampp\htdocs\UKK MODE SERIUS\skillhub'
STEP 2: Jalankan Setup
.\start-midtrans-setup.bat
Akan muncul 4 windows:

✅ Window 1: Reverb WebSocket (jangan ditutup)
✅ Window 2: Queue Worker (jangan ditutup)
✅ Window 3: Laravel Server (jangan ditutup)
✅ Window 4: ngrok (cari URL disini)
STEP 3: Copy ngrok URL
Lihat Window 4 (ngrok), cari baris seperti ini:

Forwarding    https://abc123.ngrok-free.app -> http://localhost:8000
